1
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:31,649
Rinkham,

2
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:37,027
do you know what the people in town are saying about you?

3
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:41,040
Let them talk.

4
00:00:42,535 --> 00:00:43,704
It is no small matter.

5
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:45,956
You are far too close with Kaew.

6
00:00:46,290 --> 00:00:48,227
Whomever I am close with is my own business.

7
00:00:48,246 --> 00:00:51,156
No, it is not, not as long as you are my child.

8
00:00:51,193 --> 00:00:53,932
Then what am I? Merely a tool for you, Dad?

9
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:55,353
You do not understand.

10
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:57,113
I understand completely.

11
00:00:57,450 --> 00:01:00,615
You are controlling my life to suit your own desires.

12
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:05,132
Regardless, you must marry Khun Chai Phakdee.

13
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:08,393
If he can put up with me, let him try.

14
00:01:20,609 --> 00:01:21,612
It looks beautiful.

15
00:01:23,130 --> 00:01:24,030
Make plenty of it.

16
00:01:24,061 --> 00:01:24,560
Yes, Lady.

17
00:01:24,603 --> 00:01:25,175
Yes, Lady.

18
00:01:27,930 --> 00:01:29,236
Lady Rinkham.

19
00:01:31,230 --> 00:01:33,064
Today, I will take you out.

20
00:01:33,990 --> 00:01:34,996
I am not going.

21
00:01:37,450 --> 00:01:38,252
But we are about to be engaged.

22
00:01:38,289 --> 00:01:41,458
We are not engaged yet, do not be so hasty.

23
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:46,307
Kaew, I want some sweets.

24
00:01:54,710 --> 00:01:56,104
Feed me, Kaew.

25
00:01:59,790 --> 00:02:00,756
I told you to do it.

26
00:02:14,356 --> 00:02:20,523
Hey, you don't need to let the caretaker do everything like this.

27
00:02:23,550 --> 00:02:25,212
I am content with this.

28
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,310
Or are you dissatisfied?

29
00:02:30,380 --> 00:02:33,963
Kaew, fix my hair for me, please.

30
00:02:53,470 --> 00:02:56,910
Hey, I think we should talk in private.

31
00:02:58,700 --> 00:02:59,643
I am not free.

32
00:03:00,660 --> 00:03:01,944
I am sleepy now.

33
00:03:03,260 --> 00:03:05,169
No matter who it is, do not disturb me.

34
00:03:27,587 --> 00:03:29,580
You shouldn't speak like that in front of others.

35
00:03:31,350 --> 00:03:34,209
I just wanted him to see that I have made my choice.

36
00:03:35,809 --> 00:03:37,618
But you are putting yourself at risk.

37
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:39,070
I am not afraid.

38
00:03:39,723 --> 00:03:41,489
Or is it you who is scared?

39
00:03:42,900 --> 00:03:44,030
I am not afraid.

40
00:03:45,130 --> 00:03:48,381
Then prove it to me.

41
00:03:50,170 --> 00:03:52,916
I only want you to be careful with your words and actions.

42
00:03:54,270 --> 00:03:55,569
It might cause…

43
00:04:08,990 --> 00:04:10,233
And what about you?

44
00:04:11,341 --> 00:04:12,480
What should you be careful of?

45
00:04:16,790 --> 00:04:19,833
I should be careful of you, Rinkham.

46
00:05:12,984 --> 00:05:14,116
It's broad daylight,

47
00:05:15,290 --> 00:05:16,756
and the house is full of people.

48
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:19,076
You shouldn’t…

49
00:05:36,806 --> 00:05:40,886
Then don't make a sound.

50
00:05:54,363 --> 00:05:56,160
You just have to endure it, that's all.

51
00:07:17,260 --> 00:07:17,778
Dad

52
00:07:18,750 --> 00:07:19,415
Dad..

53
00:07:21,169 --> 00:07:22,664
Please sit up

54
00:07:27,870 --> 00:07:29,618
and take your medicine.

55
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:31,710
Help…

56
00:07:34,700 --> 00:07:35,483
Okay

57
00:07:35,930 --> 00:07:36,775
Let me help you.

58
00:07:49,420 --> 00:07:51,747
How are you doing, Kaew?

59
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:52,726
Are you tired?

60
00:07:54,330 --> 00:07:55,249
I'm not tired.

61
00:07:56,390 --> 00:07:57,372
I'm used to it.

62
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:07,267
Someone’s coming…

63
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:17,932
What is the meaning of this, you all?

64
00:08:23,350 --> 00:08:24,510
Lord Wisanu…

65
00:08:34,010 --> 00:08:36,283
I have no issue with you being in love with Rinkham.

66
00:08:37,458 --> 00:08:39,450
But I just found out something from someone,

67
00:08:40,220 --> 00:08:41,409
so I came to prove it.

68
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:43,987
You are a woman!

69
00:08:44,780 --> 00:08:46,000
You deceived me!

70
00:08:46,910 --> 00:08:48,196
Please let me explain.

71
00:08:48,410 --> 00:08:49,070
Enough!

72
00:08:51,270 --> 00:08:55,784
From now on, Rinkham will be entering the engagement ceremony with Khun Chai Phakdee.

73
00:08:56,830 --> 00:08:58,830
She has someone else to protect her in your place now.

74
00:08:59,450 --> 00:09:02,498
Therefore, you must leave my house.

75
00:09:02,793 --> 00:09:04,790
Get out of my daughter's life,

76
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:06,978
and never let me see your face again.

77
00:09:09,130 --> 00:09:10,516
Please let me explain.

78
00:09:10,710 --> 00:09:11,827
I don't want to hear it.

79
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:18,473
From this moment on, you are no longer a citizen of my town.

80
00:09:19,138 --> 00:09:21,130
I give you only one month

81
00:09:21,740 --> 00:09:23,833
to get out of this town.

82
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:28,732
Otherwise, don't say I didn't warn you.

83
00:09:39,470 --> 00:09:40,141
Kaew.

84
00:09:46,140 --> 00:09:46,812
Dad.

85
00:09:49,864 --> 00:09:51,544
What on earth happened, my child?

86
00:09:54,615 --> 00:09:56,610
I just wanted to get money to cure your illness.

87
00:09:58,030 --> 00:09:59,556
I just wanted you to get better,

88
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,858
so that we could have a better life.

89
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:08,246
That’s why I disguised myself as a man,

90
00:10:10,387 --> 00:10:12,627
thinking I could keep everything under control.

91
00:10:15,010 --> 00:10:16,067
But I was wrong.

92
00:10:17,550 --> 00:10:22,652
I disappointed the people I love

93
00:10:25,770 --> 00:10:27,101
and brought trouble to everyone.

94
00:10:32,170 --> 00:10:33,095
I’m so sorry.

95
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:36,910
Do you love her?

96
00:10:38,010 --> 00:10:41,723
I love her with all my heart.

97
00:10:45,390 --> 00:10:46,941
If you truly love her,

98
00:10:48,410 --> 00:10:52,036
that love will bring you back together.

99
00:10:57,156 --> 00:10:59,150
I used to believe in fate…

100
00:11:01,610 --> 00:11:05,895
but now, I’m not so sure.

101
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:33,273
Where is Kaew?

102
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,421
Why are you so late today?

103
00:11:37,796 --> 00:11:39,790
Don't waste your time waiting for her.

104
00:11:41,089 --> 00:11:43,080
I’ve banished her from the city

105
00:11:43,809 --> 00:11:45,800
and he better never show her face around here again.

106
00:11:47,212 --> 00:11:48,190
What?!

107
00:11:49,310 --> 00:11:51,538
He isn't fit to be anywhere near you.

108
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:54,898
What have you done? Why...?

109
00:11:54,916 --> 00:11:58,147
You know full well in your heart why I drove her away.

110
00:11:58,530 --> 00:11:59,618
She lied.

111
00:12:00,140 --> 00:12:01,286
You lied.

112
00:12:02,260 --> 00:12:04,473
You aren't the only one who knows

113
00:12:04,516 --> 00:12:06,689
that Kaewket is actually a woman.

114
00:12:08,680 --> 00:12:09,926
I hate you, Dad!

115
00:12:10,490 --> 00:12:11,741
But I love you.

116
00:12:11,778 --> 00:12:13,076
I only want what's best for you.

117
00:12:14,350 --> 00:12:15,396
Love?

118
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:20,824
What about my love?

119
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:23,040
Have you ever thought about that at all?!

120
00:12:27,692 --> 00:12:32,744
From now on, you will be engaged to Khun Chai Phakdee.

121
00:12:33,575 --> 00:12:35,570
And it must happen as soon as possible.
